# x11{x11easter=yes}: classic X-11 Easter holiday adjustment (getx11.f:470-474
# -> Keastr; editor Khol=1/Lgenx=T; xrgdrv transparent pass -> holday/holidy/
# easter estimate the Easter factor into X11hol, folded as a prior).
